<section class="context-section" aria-labelledby="context-heading"><div class="container context-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Connections, not silos</p><h2 id="context-heading">One platform.<br />One business<br /><em>context.</em></h2><p>Serga connects the records most businesses keep separate.</p><p>A contract belongs to a customer or supplier. A leased asset belongs to a location and an agreement. A subscription belongs to a customer. A service connects a provider with a customer.</p><p>Serga keeps those relationships together — so you see the business context, not just another record.</p><a class="text-link" href="/platform">Meet the platform <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><partial name="_ContextMap" /></div></section>
